# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file: findings we have checked and accepted, each with why.
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-FFLATE-22392372:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Not reachable. The flaw is in fflate's ZIP extraction (unzipSync), which
          allocates whatever uncompressed size a crafted ZIP entry declares. The SDK
          never extracts ZIP: it inflates a BoundView image's zlib data with the
          streaming Unzlib, a kilobyte at a time, and stops once past the image's
          stated width x height x 4 (boundViewSchema.ts; a 64 MB bomb is refused in
          milliseconds, documentFields.test.ts). No fixed fflate exists yet: when this
          expires, check for one.
        expires: 2027-02-15T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
